    :param self: ChoiceField. An instance of the ChoiceField class.
    :param choices: List. A list of choices.
    :param group_index: Integer. The index of the choice group.
    :return: Iterator. An iterator of options for rendering select widgets.
    """
    for index, choice in enumerate(choices, group_index):
        if isinstance(choice, (list, tuple)):
            group_index = index
            for option in _iter_options(choice, group_index):
                yield option
        else:
            yield (choice, choice, self.html_cutoff_text if index >= self.html_cutoff else None, group_index)

